        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Regardless, they must be replaced with less talky-walky fish. Simple fish. Like delicious Valencian Snapper. Perhaps you have a way to do this?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520450,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "A Frame of Mind? Non, we have seen no such thing. But I wonder...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520450,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Maybe the talking fish was actually Dasein reaching out, Citizen. It did mention a frame, eh.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Moose_Manticore_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/The_Valet_NV-ROSE_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520451,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I was just about to say that, you vitamin-deficient lackwit! Desole, Wizard, the Moosetaurs once oppressed us for the Walrusks.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_019.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520450,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Some retain their rudeness to Pingouins. But he is right about the fish. 'The Frame is behind the table,' it said.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_020.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520450,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perhaps it means Sur La Café Table... it was the very first thing we built when we settled in. Go now. Talk to its proprietor.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_021.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520450,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Earthquakes? Who was fighting? I specifically ordered peace. If I find out who was fighting, they will get the back of my fin.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520450,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-ROSE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "There. That should settle things down. Hrumph, it was probably Monquistans anyway. Very temperamental, spreading their drama to our shores.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_MaxineF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maxine_Rockhoppierre_NV-ROSE_023.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
